anguage-enumeration]]，识别类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。"},{"id":"52160274657632e4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Delta)$；$A,B\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\Sigma}$、$D,E\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\Sigma}$。语言类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；词运算和同态见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]、[[73-df-word-homomorphism]]。$h:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Delta^*$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(h)$。"},{"id":"ac868dc670f0e475","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bff9c8d0e9f70335","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathsf{RE}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。"},{"id":"01bc45e73c237530","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。一般文法及其语言见 [[73-df-unrestricted-grammar-semantics]]，识别类见 [[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]。"},{"id":"8b305a2bf9bf1b98","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$。$A_{\\mathsf{TM},\\mathcal E}$、$\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}$ 见 [[73-df-paired-acceptance-language]]、[[73-df-paired-halting-language]]；$\\le_m$ 与识别类见 [[73-df-binary-many-one-reduction]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]；已知分类见 [[73-thm-binary-universal-language-classification]]、[[73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability]]。"}],"outgoing":["888d8ab66ec7efca"]}